# induction-skill milestone close: reader brief (common part)

You are one of four independent local readers of a milestone close in the GND
repository (a Python CLI that checks ORM models and populations). The plan's
decision D13 selects "four local reviewer agents for the plan and close review".
Your opinion is advisory; the owner and the close ruling decide.

